    "title": "Graphic testimony ends second day of Faith Hedgepeth murder trial: What you need to know before Day 3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hannah Leyva ,\n6 hours ago\nDURHAM, N.C. ( WNCN ) — The second day of the Faith Hedgepeth murder trial will began where the first day left off — with her roommate Karena Rosario on the witness stand.\nThe prosecution finished their questioning of Rosario late Wednesday afternoon. Due to the late hour, the judge told the defense team they could begin her cross-examination of her first thing Thursday morning.\nDay 1: Faith Hedgepeth murder trial begins, roommate takes stand, expected to take it again Thursday After her testimony is over, other witnesses will also be called to the stand by the prosecution,\nCatch up on what happened on the first day here , and follow along for live updates from the second day below.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WBTW.",
